===Etymology===
{{inh+|fr|frm|tout}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|tot}}, from {{inh|fr|VL.|tōttus}}, alteration (likely via expressive gemination) of {{der|fr|la|tōtus}}. Compare {{cog|ca|tot}}, {{cog|it|tutto}}, {{cog|pt|todo}}, {{cog|ro|tot}}, {{cog|es|todo}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA|+|qual2=in liaison|tou.t‿}}
